  "job_B9.2.4_20251003_114951": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00c6fter \u00f0\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s III hunde wintra & LVII, on \u00fe\u00e6m dagum \u00fee Gallie Roma \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee L\u00e6cedemonie h\u00e6fdon Perse oft oferwunnen, \u00fea gebudon him Perse \u00fe\u00e6t hie h\u00e6fden Hie \u00fea L\u00e6cedemoni\u00e6 lustlice \u00fe\u00e6re sibbe hirsumedan, for \u00fe\u00e6m lytlan ege \u00fee him mon gebead. On \u00fe\u00e6m mon m\u00e6g sweotole oncnawan hu micelne willan hie to \u00f0\u00e6m gewinne h\u00e6fdon swa heora Ne ge\u00feync\u00f0 \u00fee swelc gewin noht lustb\u00e6re, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, ne \u00fea tida \u00feon ma, \u00fe\u00e6tte him his feond \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee L\u00e6cedemonie h\u00e6fdon oferwunnen Ahtene \u00fea burg, hiora agene leode, hi hie \u00fea up L\u00e6cedemonie w\u00e6ron swa uppah\u00e6fene, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6g\u00f0er ge hie self wendon ge ealle \u00f0a neah\u00feeoda \u00fe\u00e6t Ac him Ahteniense mid Thebana fultume wi\u00f0stodon, & hie mid gefeohte cnysedan. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m L\u00e6cedemonie gecuron him to ladteowe, Ircclidis w\u00e6s haten, & hiene sendon on Perse Him \u00fea Perse mid heora tw\u00e6m ealdormonnum ongean coman; o\u00feer hatte Farnabuses, o\u00feer Sona swa \u00feara L\u00e6cedemonia ladteow wiste \u00fe\u00e6t he wi\u00f0 \u00fea twegen heras sceolde, him \u00fea r\u00e6dlecre & he swa gedyde, & his \u00e6renddracan to o\u00ferum onsende, & him secgan het \u00fe\u00e6t he geornor wolde He \u00fea se ealdormon geliefedlice mid sibbe \u00feara \u00e6rende anfeng, & L\u00e6",
